            "title": "For loop",
            "id": 59930,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir listenin tüm öğeleri arasında <code>for</code> döngüsünü kullanarak dolaşmanın kolay bir yolu vardır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"final_scores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" final_scores:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(score)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Four executions",
            "id": 59920,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>final_scores</code> listesindeki öğeler arasında döngü oluşturmak için <code>for</code> yazıp ardından <code>score</code> gibi bir değişkeni, <code>in</code> kelimesini ve <code>final_scores</code> listesini yazarız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"final_scores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" final_scores:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(score)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"58\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>for</code>, ardından <code>score</code> ve sonra <code>in</code>, <code>final_scores</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir listede döngü oluşturmak için <code>for</code>, geçerli öğeyi tutan bir değişken, <code>in</code> ve liste adını yaz.</p><p>Her skor ayrı bir satırda yazdırılacak şekilde listede döngü oluştur: <code>17</code>, <code>22</code>, <code>34</code>, <code>13</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"final_scores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" final_scores:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(score)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"36\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>for</code>, ardından <code>score</code>, <code>in</code> ve son olarak <code>final_scores</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Length",
            "id": 59924,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Döngü, listede kaç öğe varsa o kadar kez çalışır. Burada <code>print(score)</code> kodunu yazarak konsolda dört öğe göreceğiz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"final_scores = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"22\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"34\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" final_scores:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(score)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"74\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"17\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"22\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"34\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>print(score)</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "for",
            "id": 59925,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>in</code> ifadesinden önceki değişken, döngünün o anda üzerinde bulunduğu liste öğesinin değerini tutar. Burada değişken olarak <code>artist</code> kullanacağız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"artists = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Chagall&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lissitzky&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artist \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artists:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(artist)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Chagall\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Lissitzky\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>for</code>, ardından <code>artist</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>in</code> öncesindeki değişken, döngünün o anda bulunduğu liste öğesini tutar. Adını döngü gövdesine uyacak şekilde seç.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"artists = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Chagall&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lissitzky&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artist \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" artists:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(artist)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;----&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"artists\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Chagall\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Lissitzky\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"----\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>for</code>, ardından <code>artist</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
