          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 81307,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kodda yanlış olan ne?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"singers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bowie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Freddie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singer \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singers:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(singer)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>in</code> ve <code>for</code> ifadelerinin konumu karıştırılmış</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Bu kodda yanlış olan hiçbir şey yok</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>in</code> ve <code>for</code> ifadelerinin konumu karıştırılmış.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir liste döngüsü başlığında sırasıyla <code>for</code>, döngü değişkeni, <code>in</code> ve liste yer alır.</p><p>Geçersiz başlığın yerine hangi satır gelmelidir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"singers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bowie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Freddie&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"] \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singer \" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" singers:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(singer)\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>for singer in singers:</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>for singers in singer:</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>in singer for singers:</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>for singer in singers:</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
