            "id": 81308,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kod konsolda ne görüntüler?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"consoles = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playstation&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Xbox&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" console \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" consoles:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(console)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Playstation\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Xbox\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Playstation\"</code> ve <code>\"Xbox\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"> Konsolda hiçbir şey görüntülenmiyor</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>\"Playstation\"</code> ve <code>\"Xbox\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Döngü çalışmadan önce <code>consoles</code> listesinin sonuna <code>\"Nintendo\"</code> eklenirse çıktı nasıl değişir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"consoles = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playstation&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Xbox&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" console \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" consoles:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(console)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Playstation\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Xbox\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Nintendo</code>, <code>Xbox</code> değerinden sonra yeni bir satırda görünür.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Döngü yalnızca iki değeri ziyaret edebildiği için çıktı aynı kalır.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Yeni değerler önce ziyaret edildiği için <code>Nintendo</code>, <code>Playstation</code> değerinden önce görünür.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Nintendo</code>, <code>Xbox</code> değerinden sonra yeni bir satırda görünür.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 81309,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>for döngüsünün içine bir <code>print()</code> ifadesi ekle ve <code>item</code> öğesini görüntüle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"items = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;tomato&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" items:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(item)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"items:\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"milk\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tomato\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apple\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>print</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>item</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Döngünün içinde <code>item</code> değişkeni her seferinde bir öğeyi tutar.</p><p>Konsolda ayrı satırlarda <code>milk</code>, <code>tomato</code> ve <code>apple</code> görünmesi için her öğeyi yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"items = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;milk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;tomato&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;apple&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" items:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(item)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"items\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"milk\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tomato\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"apple\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>print</code>, ardından <code>(</code>, <code>item</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
