            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>supplies</code> listesiyle bir for döngüsü oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"supplies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;pencil&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" value \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" supplies:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(value)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"pencil\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"book\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>for</code>, ardından <code>in</code> ve sonra <code>supplies</code>, <code>:</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Konsolda önce <code>pencil</code>, ardından <code>book</code> görünmesi için <code>supplies</code> listesinde döngü oluştur ve her öğeyi yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"supplies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;pencil&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" value \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" supplies:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(value)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"pencil\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"book\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>for</code>, ardından <code>in</code>, <code>supplies</code> ve son olarak <code>:</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
